# --- Curated, committable openkbp-opt sample (small subset; see sample_data/openkbp_opt/README.md) ---
# The bulk dataset stays ignored (data/, *.npz above); the tracked sample is re-included,
# including its dij.npz which the global *.npz rule would otherwise exclude.
!sample_data/**/*.npz
